      "text": "Pattern Matching Problem\nText T of length n, Pattern P of length m\nCandidate Windows = n - m + 1",
      "originalText": "Pattern Matching Problem\nText T of length n, Pattern P of length m\nCandidate Windows = n - m + 1",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ch16-01-pattern-matching-naive-vs-rk-n0",
