      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u2022 Convert Pattern P to integer patHash once in O(m)\n\u2022 Precompute prefix hashes hs[] in O(n)\n\u2022 Compare 1 integer hash per window in O(1)\n\u2022 Expected / Average Time: O(n + m)",
      "originalText": "\u2022 Convert Pattern P to integer patHash once in O(m)\n\u2022 Precompute prefix hashes hs[] in O(n)\n\u2022 Compare 1 integer hash per window in O(1)\n\u2022 Expected / Average Time: O(n + m)",
